  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"30\">\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/u.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"30\">O.COUPON(울온쿠폰,시디구입처)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"22\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/r_line.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"177\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"220\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/aos_lbox.gif\" width=\"156\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"323\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Age \n                                        Of Shadows(암흑의 시대)</span></b></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">제품 정보:</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br>제품명 : \n                                        암흑의 시대<br>판매원: Electronic Arts<br>개발: Origin Systems<br>사용환경: Windows95/98/XP \nCD-Rom<br>장르: MMORPG (Massively Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>이전 \n                                        패키지인 르네상스,블랙손의복수등을 구입하지 \n                                        </b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>않으셔도 AOS하나만 구입하시면 모든 \n                                        것을 즐기실 수 있습니다.</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/r_line.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#333333\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:3; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>AOS특징</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:3; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">새로운 땅 말라스의 유혹, 그 곳에서 당신의 진정한 도전이 시작된다.</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가장 오래된 온라인 게임, 그러나 가장 새로운 온라인 \n게임인<br>울티마 온라인: 암흑의 시대(Age of Shadows™)가 온라인 게임을 선도하는 게임답게 <br>지금껏 어떠한 온라인 게임에서도 \n시도되었던 적이 없는 자신만의 고유의 집 건축 시스템과<br>전투 시스템, 그리고 네크로맨서와 팔라딘이라는 새로운 두 종류의 직업으로 \n<br>강력하게 무장한채 여러분의 곁으로 다가갑니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>A</b>.&nbsp;마법(Magery)능력과 마찬가지로, 어둠의 기술에 더 익숙해 질수록, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:3; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">악의 힘은 더욱 강력해집니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">심령술(Spirit Speak)을 익힌 \n네크로멘서는 악의에 찬 16가지의 네크로맨서용 마법을 보다 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잘 사용 할 수 있습니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>B</b>. 악이 있는 곳에는 선이 존재하며, 어둠이 있는 \n곳에는 반드시 밝음이 존재합니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">암흑의 시대에서의 그 밝음이란 팔라딘을 지칭합니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잘 훈련된 팔라딘들은 10가지의 팔라딘을 위한 새로운 \n기술로 어둠에 대항합니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>C</b>. \n                                        하우스 디자인 툴로 마치 심즈처럼 자신이 원하는 형태의 집을 마음대로 지을 수 있습니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">여러분의 취향대로 \n마음껏 집을 건축 해 보세요.브리타니아에 존재하는 기존의 “클래식”집들은 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">인테리어용 하우스 미니어처 콜렉션으로 여러분에게 또 다른 재미를 \n드릴 것입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>D</b>. \n                                        총 4만 가구의 집을 수용할 수 있는 거대한 신대륙의 말라스의 등장으로 보다 원활한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">집짓기가 가능 해 \n집니다.(말라스에는 트라멜의 규칙이 적용됩니다.) </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>E</b>. \n                                        그 밖에 새로운 3D 아바타와 복장, 인터페이스 강화, 13가지의 새로운 전투 \n동작, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3개의 보스급을 \n                                        포함한 20가지의 추가된 몬스터, 10가지의 새로운 무기등으로 인해 보다 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">박진감 넘치는 게임이 여러분에게 현실로 \n다가옵니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:3; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b>시스템 최소 사양:</b></font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br>-Pentium III 500MHz 이상<br>-64 MB 램<br>-비디오 메모리 8MB 이상 Direct 3D \n호환 그래픽 카드<br>-Windows 95 또는그 이상의 OS \n시스템,<br>-Windows 호환 가능한 사운드 카드,<br>-850MB 이상 여유 공간</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마 온라인: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">최신 \n                                        버전인 </span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>암흑의시대(Age \n                                        Of Shadows)</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">를 구입하시면 \n                                        2D/3D를 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">선택해서 플레이 하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시디를 \n                                        구입하시고 계정등록을 하시는 방법은 \n                                        시디 매뉴얼을 참조하시고 \n                                        본홈 좌측메뉴의 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">초보자지침서를 이용하시길 \n                                        바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마온라인의 \n                                        한달이용료는11,000으로 타 \n                                        게임보다도 훨씬 저렴합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 \n                                        이번 AOS는 가격대 만족도가 \n                                        상당히 높으므로 아직 \n                                        울온을 경험해 보지 못한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">플레이어들에게는 \n                                        좋은 \n                                        기회입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:10; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n                                        : 신규계정시 1개월 무료이용도 포합되어 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><a href=\"http://www.kr.uo.com\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\">ORIGIN</font></span></b></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"